        "@id": "https://bimsaarthi.com/ontology/v0/ElementCopiesRecorded"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@value": "N41.1; the act of keeping, on each copy, which model's element the take-off counted it as. Carries the person, the time, the take-off it came from (rdfs:comment) and how many elements changed; each changed element points back at it (prov:wasInfluencedBy)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
